# Quick manual tests (VS Code REST Client / BAS). Start the app first: npm run watch
# In development, mocked users are active: alice has no password.

@host = http://localhost:4004
@auth = Basic alice:

### Ask a question
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/agent/ask
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is SAP CAP in one sentence?" }

### Same question again: served from the optimizer cache (temperature 0)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/agent/ask
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is SAP CAP in one sentence?" }

### Agent with 32 tools and a multi-turn history
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/agent/runAgent
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "What is the status of sales order 4711?" }

### Mock AI Core scenarios (development only): rate limit, content filter, context length, server error
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/agent/ask
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Trigger a rate limit [[mock:rate_limit]]" }

### Admin service: totals (user ops has the TokenOptimizerAdmin role)
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/token-optimizer/summary()
Authorization: Basic ops:

### Admin service: per use case
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/token-optimizer/UseCases
Authorization: Basic ops:

### Admin service: savings per step
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/token-optimizer/StepSavings
Authorization: Basic ops:
